stella pure-C port — source and license notices
Audit date: 2026-10-01

This directory is a collection of differently licensed components. SPDX
headers describe individual files; there is no blanket MIT/BSD license
covering the whole port. LICENSES/files.json maps every c/ file and the
production Eigen PnP helper to its license and recorded provenance.
An AND expression retains the terms of each component in a mixed file;
it does not relicense the upstream material. Existing notices are retained.

New project-authored harnesses, data records and driver additions are MIT,
Copyright (c) 2026 Pose Validation contributors (LICENSES/MIT.txt).
Their linked implementations retain their own licenses. These labels do
not extend to third-party input fixtures or vocabulary data.

