PoseLib (stella_vio only)
------------------------
Source: https://github.com/PoseLib/PoseLib (read as reference; BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2020, Viktor Larsson),
license text LICENSES/poselib-BSD-3-Clause.txt. c/sv_poselib.{c,h} are own C99 code that follows PoseLib's ideas: LO-RANSAC with
MSAC scoring and local optimisation, Sampson-error relative-pose refinement and reprojection pose refinement with a Cauchy loss and
Levenberg-Marquardt damping, P3P absolute pose. The minimal solver is Grunert's distance formulation and the Jacobians are central
differences, so no PoseLib source is copied; the BSD-3 notice is kept because the structure follows PoseLib. The files are used only
by opt-in switches (init_refine, init_lo, pnp_lo) and are not part of the exact port (stella_port/).

